From ca3cf4c26619ccd4288748854f363808f675e51a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net(v2): add NODE_UTXO_SHARD capability, 50-block undo
 horizon, forward peel script verification, and batch shorttx relay

Integrate Lotus V2 consensus rules (`fIsLotusV2`) with Tachyon P2P fast-path
extensions: ensure Merklix reverse peel ordering and `ConnectBlock` multi-threaded
pre-caching respect V2 topological sorting and state commitment verification.
